{"id":"torrey:hittites","source":"torrey","name":"Hittites","slug":"hittites","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Descended from Canaan’s son, Heth — Ge 10:15.","refs":[["Gen",10,15,10,15]]},{"text":"Sons of Heth. — Ge 23:3,20.","refs":[["Gen",23,3,23,3],["Gen",23,20,23,20]]},{"text":"Children of Heth. — Ge 23:5.","refs":[["Gen",23,5,23,5]]},{"text":"One of the seven nations of Canaan — De 7:1.","refs":[["Deut",7,1,7,1]]},{"text":"Dwelt in Hebron — Ge 23:2,3,19.","refs":[["Gen",23,2,23,2],["Gen",23,3,23,3],["Gen",23,19,23,19]]},{"text":"Governed by kings — 1Ki 10:29; 2Ki 7:6.","refs":[["1Kgs",10,29,10,29],["2Kgs",7,6,7,6]]},{"text":"Land of, promised to Israel — Ge 15:20; Ex 3:8.","refs":[["Gen",15,20,15,20],["Exod",3,8,3,8]]},{"text":"Israel commanded to destroy — De 7:1,2,24.","refs":[["Deut",7,1,7,1],["Deut",7,2,7,2],["Deut",7,24,7,24]]},{"text":"Part of their land given to Caleb — Jos 14:13.","refs":[["Josh",14,13,14,13]]},{"text":"Not entirely destroyed by Israel — Jdj 3:5.","refs":[["Judg",3,5,3,5]]},{"text":"The remnant of, made tributary in the reign of Solomon — 1Ki 9:20,21.","refs":[["1Kgs",9,20,9,20],["1Kgs",9,21,9,21]]},{"text":"Luz built in the country of — Jdj 1:26.","refs":[["Judg",1,26,1,26]]},{"text":"Esau. — Ge 36:2.","refs":[["Gen",36,2,36,2]]},{"text":"Solomon. — 1Ki 11:1,2.","refs":[["1Kgs",11,1,11,1],["1Kgs",11,2,11,2]]},{"text":"Israel after conquest of Canaan. — Jdj 3:5,6.","refs":[["Judg",3,5,3,5],["Judg",3,6,3,6]]},{"text":"Israelites after the captivity. — Ezr 9:1.","refs":[["Ezra",9,1,9,1]]},{"text":"Descent from, illustrative of the degradation of the Jews — Eze 16:3.","refs":[["Ezek",16,3,16,3]]},{"text":"Ephron. — Ge 49:30.","refs":[["Gen",49,30,49,30]]},{"text":"Abimelech. — 1Sa 26:6.","refs":[["1Sam",26,6,26,6]]},{"text":"Uriah. — 2Sa 11:6,21.","refs":[["2Sam",11,6,11,6],["2Sam",11,21,11,21]]}],"refCount":31}
